  "historyNote": "#10410, eff 9-13-13; ss by #10631, eff 7-1-14; amd by #11107, eff 7-1-16; amd by #12016, eff 10-25-16; ss by #13474, eff 10-24-22; ss by #13879, eff 2-21-24; ss by #14240, eff 4-22-25, EXPIRES: 4-22-35",
